*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "THERMOR.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "thermorinter"
*Product: "(Thermorinter Cat Printer)"
*ModelName: "Thermorinter Cat Printer"
*ShortNickName: "Thermorinter"
*NickName: "Thermorinter Cat Printer"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*cupsVersion: "2.0"
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*% Make CUPS convert every job to PDF and pass it straight to the backend,
*% which forwards it to thermorinterd /print/pdf.
*cupsFilter: "application/pdf 0 -"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Roll58
*PageSize Roll58/58mm Roll: "<</PageSize[164 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Roll58
*PageRegion Roll58/58mm Roll: "<</PageSize[164 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Roll58
*ImageableArea Roll58/58mm Roll: "0 0 164 792"
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "0 0 595 842"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "0 0 612 792"

*DefaultPaperDimension: Roll58
*PaperDimension Roll58/58mm Roll: "164 792"
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
